            "review_title": "Review at Beach House City Garden",
            "review_text": "Mia Le\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam16 contributions\n2\nA tropical oasis in the heart of city\nAug 2024 • Friends\nBeach House was the perfect escape from the hustle and bustle of the city. The tropical oasis atmosphere, complete with lush greenery and a stunning pool, instantly transported me to a faraway paradise. \n\nThe food was delicious, with a great balance of flavors and fresh ingredients. The service was impeccable, and the staff were friendly and attentive. \n\nI highly recommend Beach House for a relaxing and enjoyable weekend getaway\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten September 18, 2024\nVintage Collection\nThank you so much for the 5-star review! 🌟 We truly appreciate your support and are thrilled to know you had a great experience with us. We look forward to serving you again soon!\nRead more\nWritten October 1, 2024\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
