            "review_title": "Review at Beach House City Garden",
            "review_text": "Anh Amắn 🇻🇳\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam12939 contributions\n25\nBeach cafe in Saigon\nSep 2024 • Solo\nI am back for my annual trip to Vietnam and staying at City Garden for the Saigon portion again for 9 nights. \n\nI have been eating on average once a day at Beach house Cafe on the grounds of City Garden. I love their breakfasts, the eggs Benedict especially with ham off the bone and spinach is one of my favourite starts to the day.. I like their Pizza’s too. Worth remembering Tuesday night’s is still their 2 pizzas for the price of one offer. You just can’t beat that! I also love their fish main meals.\n\nService is always professional yet friendly. I simply enjoy eating here and I am not the only one the place has a very loyal following.\nRead more\nWritten September 12, 2024\nVintage Collection\nWe're jumping for joy to hear that you loved your time at Beach House! Your positive feedback is our greatest reward. Thank you for choosing us. Have a nice trip and hope to see you back in Vietnam soon!\nRead more\nWritten September 18, 2024\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
