            "review_title": "Review at Beach House City Garden",
            "review_text": "Anh Amắn 🇻🇳\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam12939 contributions\n45\nAussie Style Beach Restaurant/Cafe in Saigon\nOct 2022 • Solo\nThis is located in the high end luxury City Garden residential complex in the Bình Thạnh district. \n\nI have eaten here a few times in the past week as i have been renting an apartment here. The vibe is very Australian Beach Cafe which fits nicely into the overall resort style feel of the complex. The breakfasts in my opinion are their greatest attraction - they are simply delicious and there is a good variety. They also have good range of western and local meals, salads, pizzas and even the humble toasted sandwich has a makeover to a delicious and super filling meal. They have a bbq menu after 5pm, also theme nights like 2 pizzas for the price of 1 night. \n\nAll the staff are super friendly, courteous and speak English. Prices are above average for local places but fair for such a setting. I personally like it here and have even had a couple of meetings with colleagues here. Vietnamese colleagues are always stunned by the resort style feel and truly get a kick out of coming here. If you live in the complex you are probably already a fan. If you live outside, treat yourself to special weekend brunch, you will not be disappointed.\n\np.s for the full authentic touch they should keep a jar of Vegemite on hand … i would had loved the option of ordering it for breakfast on my toast!\nRead more\nWritten October 24, 2022\nVintage Collection\nThank you so much for your kind words! We're delighted to hear that you enjoyed your experience. We look forward to serving you again soon.\nRead more\nWritten September 5, 2024\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
